Data sources notice
-------------------
This engine ingests and transforms third-party legal datasets
(e.g. DILA LEGI open data under the French Licence ouverte v2.0;
Legilux / Service central de législation under CC BY 4.0). The engine
itself is data-agnostic; redistributing ingested data remains subject
to the licenses of the upstream sources, which remain authoritative.
No legal data is distributed with this repository; test fixtures are
real public legal texts reused under their source licenses.
